# Data platform boundaries

## data/ (lightweight)

- data/sample/: small simulated CSV fixtures; safe for git and CI
- data/raw/: staging imports; do not commit real or licensed payloads
- data/processed/: intermediate exports; do not commit large corpora
- data/external/: reference tables; default is gitignored

## data_store/ (authoritative local corpus)

- Real MO historical data lives here on disk only
- Do not commit parquet, csv, or json market data to GitHub
- Keep data_store/.gitkeep if the directory must exist in git

## Target layout for real minute quotes

- data_store/quotes/minute/MO/{symbol}/{trade_date}.parquet
- Quality sidecars under data_store/quality/

## Downloader policy

- Do not implement downloaders unless the current Issue explicitly allows it
- Downloader output must not remain permanently under data/raw/

